msgid "Ubuntu Hello Configuration"
msgstr "Fandrindrana Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/main.ui:60
msgid "Face models"
msgstr "Modely tarehy"

#: src/main.ui:75
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Saripikan'ny tavanao izay ampitahaina amin'i Ubuntu Hello. Tehirizo roa "
"farafahakeliny, voarakitra amin'ny hazavana samihafa."

#: src/main.ui:97
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Mampiseho modely voatahiry ho an'ny:"

#: src/main.ui:137
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Glasses, a change of facial hair or "
"different lighting change how your face looks to the camera, so a single "
"model can fail (for example in the evening under lamps). Add a second model "
"with glasses on or off, your other look, or in different light to keep "
"unlocking reliable."
msgstr ""
"Maodelin'ny tarehy iray ihany no voasoratra. Ny solomaso, ny fiovan'ny "
"volombava na ny hazavana hafa dia manova ny fahitan'ny fakan-tsary ny "
"tarehinao, ka mety tsy hahomby ny maodely tokana (ohatra amin'ny hariva eo "
"ambanin'ny jiro). Ampio maodely faharoa miaraka amin'ny solomaso na tsia, ny "
"endrikao hafa, na amin'ny hazavana hafa mba hitoetra azo antoka ny famohana."

#: src/main.ui:146
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Manampia modely faharoa"

#: src/main.ui:227
msgid "Models"
msgstr "modely"

#: src/main.ui:261
msgid "Camera"
msgstr "Fakan-tsary"

#: src/main.ui:276
msgid ""
"The camera Ubuntu Hello uses to look for your face, with a live preview."
msgstr ""
"Ny fakan-tsary Ubuntu Hello dia ampiasaina hitadiavana ny tavanao, miaraka "
"amin'ny fijerena mivantana."

