msgid "Real resolution:"
msgstr "tena fanapahan-kevitra:"

#: src/main.ui:331
msgid "Used resolution:"
msgstr "Famahana ampiasaina:"

#: src/main.ui:347
msgid "Recorder:"
msgstr "Mpanoratra:"

#: src/main.ui:393
msgid "Video"
msgstr "Horonan-tsary"

#: src/main.ui:430 src/main.ui:583
msgid "Notifications"
msgstr "fampahatsiahivana"

#: src/main.ui:445
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, then "
"reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"Misy fampandrenesana eo amin'ny desktop rehefa mitady ny tavanao i Ubuntu "
"Hello, avy eo mitatitra ny valiny. Ny andrana tsy nahomby dia mijanona ao "
"amin'ny lisitry ny fampahafantarana."

#: src/main.ui:476
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Asehoy ny fampahafantarana"

#: src/main.ui:482
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the result."
msgstr ""
"Karatra iray isaky ny andrana fanamarinana tarehy, nohavaozina miaraka "
"amin'ny vokatra."

#: src/main.ui:513
msgid "Notification sounds"
msgstr "Feo fampahafantarana"

#: src/main.ui:519
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr ""
"Alefaso ny feon'ny rafitra ho an'ny fanandramana fantatra na tsy nahomby."

#: src/main.ui:550
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Ampidiro ny diagnostika"

#: src/main.ui:556
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to each "
"card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Ampio ny maodely, antoka vs. tokonam-baravarana, sary, fakan-tsary ary "
"fotoana isaky ny karatra. Mahasoa rehefa mitatitra olana."

#: src/main.ui:618 src/main.ui:734
msgid "Security"
msgstr "Fiarovana"

#: src/main.ui:633
msgid ""
"How closely your face has to match, and whether Ubuntu Hello asks you to "
"confirm that you are really there."
msgstr ""
"Ny hamafin'ny fifanarahana takiana amin'ny tarehinao, sy ny hoe mangataka "
"anao hanamarina fa tena eo ianao ve Ubuntu Hello."

#: src/main.ui:657
msgid "Face match strictness"
msgstr "Hamafin'ny fifanarahan'ny tarehy"

#: src/main.ui:665 src/onboarding.ui:151
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "fifadian-kanina"

#: src/main.ui:672 src/onboarding.ui:182
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "mandanjalanja"

#: src/main.ui:680 src/onboarding.ui:213
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "fiarovana"

#: src/main.ui:702 src/onboarding.ui:250
msgid "Ask me to nod to confirm"
msgstr "Angataho aho hanondrika ny lohako ho fanamarinana"

#: src/main.ui:708 src/onboarding.ui:259
msgid ""
"After your face matches, a notification asks you to nod. A photo held up to "
"the camera cannot nod."
msgstr ""
"Rehefa mifanaraka ny tarehinao dia misy fampahatsiahivana mangataka anao "
"hanondrika ny lohanao. Tsy afaka manondrika ny lohany ny sary atao eo "
"anoloan'ny fakan-tsary."

#: src/main.ui:771 src/onboarding.ui:759
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Fanalahidy / KWallet Auto-Mamaha"

#: src/main.ui:786
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring or "
"KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the TPM when "
"available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only master key. Face "
"auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwallet5 depending on "
"your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Alefaso ny fanamarinana tarehy mba hamahana ho azy ny keyring fidiranao na "
"KWallet rehefa miditra ianao. Izany dia mitahiry azo antoka ny teny "
"miafinao, voaisy tombo-kase ao amin'ny TPM rehefa misy, na voasivana amin'ny "
"AES-256-GCM amin'ny alalan'ny lakile lehibe ho an'ny root ihany. Ny "
"fanamarinana tarehy dia mametraka PAM_AUTHTOK ho an'ny pam_gnome_keyring na "
"pam_kwallet5, arakaraka ny biraonao."

#: src/main.ui:814
msgid "Current Status:"
msgstr "Sata ankehitriny:"

#: src/main.ui:823
msgid "Checking..."
msgstr "Manamarina..."

#: src/main.ui:834
