msgstr "Fehin-dakile"

#: src/main.ui:898
msgid "Display language"
msgstr "Fiteny aseho"

#: src/main.ui:913
msgid "Automatic follows the system language. Changes apply immediately."
msgstr ""
"Automatika manaraka ny fitenin’ny rafitra. Ampiharina avy hatrany ny fiovana."

